    "intro_narrative": "You awaken in the forgotten sanctum of the Archmage, a hidden subterranean chamber where reality bends and magic is woven into physical form. The air is thick with the scent of ozone, ancient dust, and old parchment. Flickering torches cast long, dancing shadows across walls etched with glowing runes. To escape this mystical prison, you must unlock the ultimate power of the sanctum and forge an artifact capable of breaking the warding seal. Many enchanted objects, arcane tools, and locked magical chests lie scattered around the room, each bound by intricate, interwoven dependencies. You will need to carefully trace the flow of arcane energy, using spells and artifacts in the precise order to uncover the final incantation. The ultimate goal is to ignite the master forge and synthesize the essence of pure magic to blast the doors open.",
    "narrative_style": "fantasy"
  },
